{
  "id": "navis-apexialis",
  "title": "Navis Apexialis",
  "description": "<p>A global content module for <strong>Imperium Maledictum</strong>: playable species, expanded talents, a xenos and heretic bestiary, the mechanics that drive them, and a skin for the whole interface.</p><hr /><p>The Species compendium adds a real Species item type: drop a race onto a character and it applies the whole package — characteristics, skills, traits, size and gear — with a Subspecies slot beside it. The roster is the DoomBC line converted to impmal's own scale.</p><p>Talents and the bestiary come from <em>Maledictum Expanded</em> by Meins, re-catalogued into a colour-coded folder taxonomy and repaired against the impmal system enums and the official impmal-core compendium. See <code>docs/migration-report.md</code> for every change made to the source data.</p><p>The skin repaints sheets, chat, every window, the sidebar and the hotbar in plate, brass and rust. Players can switch it off in their own settings.</p><p>Credits for Imperium Maledictum go to Moxy.</p>",
  "version": "0.2.0",
